<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady/firm - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady/firm - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were unevenly steady to firm. Demand moderate. Top $50.50 per cwt.-USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 49.50-50.50</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 1.00 lower. Top 52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  40.00-45.00</p>
<p>	 450-500 lbs.  45.00-48.00</p>
<p>	 500-600 lbs.  48.00-50.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs.  50.00-52.00</p>
</text>
